    "detailed_description": "Slav or Not is a game build around all the slavic people and their culture. <br><br>You can test your slavic knowledge as well as your skills on hand-eye coordination.<br><br>Game can be easily playable with either keyboard or mouse with either arrow keys or mouse clicks.<br><br>Player can expect 4 different game modes, some of them are testing your hand-eye coordination skill against time, some of them testing your memorization skills.<br><br>We bring fun to your PC as well as increasing skills in real life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features 4 Game Modes;</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slav Or Not</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tripoloski Challange</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don't touch Babushka</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Memorize the Slav</h2><br>In some modes, time is your enemy, some of them time is your friend. Use it wisely.<br><br>If you are slav and wanted to your images in game or have better game mode ideas ? Please contact via e-mail, we will gladly add your ideas!",
